                        "entry_id": "956a7df5-8b6a-3449-be1e-41071dc90276",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pertaining to Baal, Baalism, or the people who worshiped Baal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d1b942c-2133-4702-bf60-7e82ed040759",
                                "sense_id": "56567de7-6dcb-381b-b994-62d4c238ac52",
                                "text": "Yet , during their Babylonian captivity , it is quite possible that Baalish symbolic thinking gave the defeated Jews the needed hope to survive as a people ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4480596-af71-4544-a977-8f069b3e880d",
                                "sense_id": "56567de7-6dcb-381b-b994-62d4c238ac52",
                                "text": "There is also the theory that Jezreel was a Baalish name and thus a proclamation of Israel's apostasy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6d37e30-14f3-4af0-9844-6f6426eb3015",
                                "sense_id": "56567de7-6dcb-381b-b994-62d4c238ac52",
                                "text": "So in the height of the degeneracy and apostasy of the Israelitish church, there were seven thousand who kept themselves pure from Baalish idolatry, of whom none were known to Elijah."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1b283d9-bdff-45d1-b938-f8095380b06e",
                                "sense_id": "56567de7-6dcb-381b-b994-62d4c238ac52",
                                "text": "Oft would he cry, when treasure he surpris'd, 'Tis Baalish gold in David's coin disguis'd."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a6e3f97-db60-4191-88bc-817a16f124b8",
                                "sense_id": "56567de7-6dcb-381b-b994-62d4c238ac52",
                                "text": "The priests, who are possessed of awful lungs, made the chapel resound with their Baalish howlings, as they recited the litany for the dead."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
